{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "3e92474aca0122e19cd6b847a567d865401eea7fb845c85280b53b3a75a7835f", "ja": "{$P$}くん、待ってたわよ～♪\nそろそろ休憩の時間じゃない？　休憩の時間よね？", "zh": "{$P$}，我等你好久啦～♪\n差不多该休息了吧？　是休息时间对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1f91cf8c0c1c1fcc8d5415a1024dd00e006538d85d0a522600873894a69a7391", "ja": "まあ確かに、\nひと休みしようと思ってたところだったけど……。", "zh": "嗯，确实，我正想着休息一会儿来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "314f9e4e1042f12462f412b2d3466f31d48537e39cdb43671cc6203cfd2d6c71", "ja": "ふふん、私の読み通りね！\n実は花札を持ってきたの。息抜きに遊んでみない？", "zh": "哼哼，果然不出我所料！\n其实我带了花牌来。要不要玩玩，放松一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1003_p", "source_sha256": "03ba27ddd3d37e61fdd75d64f3b3241964114be2fd3e50d2b60ce4a4eed12e45", "ja": "それは構わないけど……なんで花札なんだ？\nあんまり莉緒が遊ぶタイプのゲームに思えないが……。", "zh": "那倒没问题，不过……为什么是花札？\n总觉得这不太像莉绪会玩的游戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "6d01a269de6269894d5d483d3f4d967c69280100008ac1660ef3d110ec4dc564", "ja": "この前、花札がモチーフの撮影をしたでしょ？\nその時に思ったのよね。", "zh": "前阵子不是拍过以花札为主题的照片吗？当时我就想到了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "bacbaf9cfdb7876c07c8e2638fb6693bd6841097317564496ead66547e2ac546", "ja": "こういう渋いゲームの駆け引きを楽しめる大人って、\nすっごくセクシーかも……なーんて♪　どう？", "zh": "能享受这种高雅游戏博弈的大人，说不定特别性感呢……之类的♪怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8406a5ef13565a00ed5f1f4b17703817984715b9c5cd4bb0967b5dbe7b681f0f", "ja": "そ、そう……かな？　まあ、人によっては\nそういうイメージを持ってる人もいる……かも？", "zh": "是、是这样……吗？不过，或许有些人确实会抱有那种印象……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "450ea3e118e2451323a65605df24ed54560c705c571e1b98a6f25293a391943e", "ja": "でしょでしょ！　相手の考えを読んで、裏をかいて、\n勝利する！　恋愛にも通じる駆け引きよね。", "zh": "对吧对吧！读懂对方的想法，出其不意地取胜！这也是恋爱中常见的心理博弈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1008_p", "source_sha256": "401b0fc9ac7ed78e1fc28059194885e2a7d539de8823c7be021f22522aa7db14", "ja": "……恋愛に通じるかはわからないけど。息抜きには\nなりそうだ。じゃあ、一緒にやってみようか。", "zh": "……我不知道这和恋爱有没有关系。不过看起来可以放松一下。那就一起试试吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "507097115760e4440f3b8fd0eb548fb61ac24303def09aab525200bc71e3f9fc", "ja": "そうこなくちゃ！　ふふっ♪　大人のお姉さんが\nキミの手の内、ぜーんぶ暴いちゃうんだから、ねっ♪", "zh": "这样才对嘛！呵呵♪　成熟大姐姐我可是会把你的底牌全都看穿的哦，知道了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0ca2ffb9d3e2f865fc60b2dcb170f477070bb76a25cd930442c83a075d74572c", "ja": "（その後、しばらく莉緒と花札を遊んだのだが……）", "zh": "（之后，我和莉绪玩了一阵花札，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "47c858107b2f53af86fe0cfbbb06882970d4b7feecfcbeefcd33b9a4bfec0d02", "ja": "な、なんで……どうしてなの～！？\nなんで一回も勝てないのよ～！　くやしい～！", "zh": "怎、怎么会……为什么啊～！？\n为什么一次都赢不了啊～！好不甘心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1012_p", "source_sha256": "76f48040bf83df1539545b1e64597c42d3633496741347d180db5514dff02d1b", "ja": "あはは……。莉緒は顔に出るタイプではあるし、\n役のつくり方も素直……というか読みやすいから。", "zh": "啊哈哈……莉绪毕竟是喜怒形于色的类型，\n而且做牌的思路也很老实……不如说是很容易看透。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "91a760d2da2c626a6efe8832ce0c58234c63fb6f3cc9252cfe68c07f727d20f1", "ja": "そうだとしても、全部負けるなんて思わなかったの～！\nうう、こんなはずじゃなかったのに……！", "zh": "就算是这样，我也没想到会全都输掉啊～！\n呜呜，事情本来不该是这样的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cbd74ddee97f79fc6dd13efe8572a4a7e07f9be0cb9c6876ee66e7842c34cb02", "ja": "まあまあ……。それだけ、担当してるアイドルのことを\nよくわかってるってことだよ。", "zh": "好啦好啦……这就说明，你很了解自己负责的偶像嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "8807f0aeb470448220583df0db53716300abe1d7bd7b011dbab46717c006048c", "ja": "ああっ！？　そのセリフ、駆け引きが上手な大人って\n感じでズルいわ！　私が言いたかったのに～！", "zh": "啊！？这句话，感觉就像是很会周旋的大人说的，太狡猾了！明明是我想说的嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2b1c5b2011edf9800b84346baf650f0f116d23e6503f4619ccc9d98d8d5f1e58", "ja": "ええ……。", "zh": "就是说啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "37bfe3a5dcea4ca0bf4bcb7a7785096761f5515ae0d5e08d334e5c97612fe02f", "ja": "うう～！　いいわ、{$P$}くん。\nもう一回よ！　私が勝てるまでやるんだから～っ！", "zh": "呜呜～！来就来，{$P$}。\n再来一局！玩到我赢为止啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0523_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dcb406beb2fa35697c44ef505b77dba536a2b446025801b3e62562f84ed81068", "ja": "（その後しばらく花札につきあったが……こういうゲー\nムには、熱くなりすぎないほうが大人だと思うぞ莉緒）", "zh": "（之后陪她玩了一阵花札……莉绪，我觉得玩这种游戏，还是别太上头比较成熟啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
